note In the Listing's toolbar, type a line number in the 'line' field and press enter: the listing selects that line and scrolls it into view, three lines from the top. The reader reaches for it to reach a known line number without scrolling for it (design.md section 6, Listing). A number past either end is clamped to the file and the status bar says so; text that is not a number, or no open file, is reported in the status bar.

